  "bamboomod.wish.result.transform.goat": "能擠奶又擅長跳躍呢。",
  "bamboomod.wish.result.transform.panda": "都說熊貓招客。字面意思嗎？",
  "bamboomod.wish.result.transform.turtle": "這甲殼，又重又硬的樣子！",
  "bamboomod.wish.result.transform.hoglin": "看著就很不擅長游泳呢。",
  "bamboomod.wish.result.transform.zoglin": "嗯，算是長得不一樣的殭屍吧？",
